# Phase-4 replay archive — drop-repick cycle: an item is picked up (leaves
# the world table), dropped again (re-registers), then claimed by two guests
# in the same frame — first-writer-wins holds after a drop re-registered the
# item ("I dropped it, someone else picked it up, I reach for it again" —
# the loser rolls back).
#
# Mechanism: FireItemDroppedReceived re-registers the item (ItemService.cs:374);
#            the pickup race is the same first-writer-wins (ItemService.cs:310-355)

@0 spawn g1 42 test_item 1.0
@33 expect host_table 42 within 500
@33 pickup g1 42 test_item 1.0
@66 expect no_host_table 42 within 500
@66 drop g1 42 test_item 1.0
@99 expect host_table 42 within 500
@99 pickup g1 42 test_item 1.0
@99 pickup g2 42 test_item 1.0
@132 expect reject g2 42 within 500
@132 expect_no_reject g1
@132 expect no_host_table 42 within 500
